  "footer": {
    "html": "<div class=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"wrapper2\">\n<div class=\"d\">\n<div class=\"r footer-r\" id=\"footer-r\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Matsuda Sangyo (Thailand) Co., Ltd.は客先の要求に応じた効率的な流通システムを持っています。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">我々はGPS付きの4～10輪トラックによる有害と無害廃棄物の輸送を提供いたします。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Matsuda Sangyo (Thailand) Co., Ltd.は高度な貴金属精錬技術と環境にやさしいノウハウで運営しております。</span></p> </div>\n<div class=\"r2 footer-r2\" id=\"footer-r2\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"r3 footer-r3\" id=\"footer-r3\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Matsuda Sangyo (Thailand) Co.,Ltd.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">Hi-Tech Industrial Estate 148 Moo 1 T.Banlen</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">A.Banpa-in, Ayutthaya 13160, Thailand.</span></p>\n<p style=\"color: #ea5504;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: CordiaUPC,times; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">Tel: (+66)35-729-001-5</span></p>\n<p style=\"color: #ea5504;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: CordiaUPC,times; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">Fax: (+66)35-729-007</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>E-mail :</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">About Starting business with us :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"mailto:sale1@matsuda-sangyo.co.th\">sale1@matsuda-sangyo.co.th</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">About Career opportunity :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"mailto:recruit@matsuda-sangyo.co.th\">recruit@matsuda-sangyo.co.th</a> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">About General matters :</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:msta-admin@matsuda-sangyo.com\">msta-admin@matsuda-sangyo.com</a></p>\n<p> </p> </div>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"bg-footer\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/legacy/images/bg-footer.png\"/>\n</div>"
